        "sid": "JDG 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kokufa kukaJoshuwa abakoIsrayeli babuza eNkosini bathi: Yisiphi isizwe esizakuhlasela amaKanani kuqala na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi: UJuda uzahamba kuqala; khangelani, ngilinikele ilizwe esandleni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJuda wathi kuSimeyoni umfowabo: Asihambe sonke siye elizweni engilinikiweyo ukuba sihlasele amaKanani; lami ngizahamba lawe elizweni olinikiweyo. USimeyoni wasehamba laye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJuda wasephuma ukuyahlasela, iNkosi yanikela amaKanani lamaPerizi ezandleni zabo; babulala abayizinkulungwane ezilitshumi eBezeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "EBezeki bamfica uAdoni‐Bezeki, balwa laye, bawanqoba amaKanani lamaPerizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdoni‐Bezeki wabaleka, baxotshana laye, bambamba, baquma izithupha zakhe lamazwane akhe amakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdoni‐Bezeki wathi: Amakhosi angamatshumi ayisikhombisa equnywe izithupha zawo lamazwane awo amakhulu ayedobha imvuthuluka ngaphansi kwetafula yami. Lokho engakwenza kuwo, uNkulunkulu usekwenze kimi. Basebemusa eJerusalema, lapho afela khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoJuda bahlasela iJerusalema, balithatha, balichitha ngomkhonto, balitshisa lonke ngomlilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokho abakoJuda bayahlasela amaKanani ayehlala ezintabeni laseNegebi laseShefela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebehlasela amaKanani ayehlala eHebroni; iHebroni kuqala kwakuthiwa yiKiriyathi‐Arba; banqoba uSheshayi loAhimani loTalimayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basuka lapho, bahlasela abaseDebiri. IDebiri kuqala kwakuthiwa yiKiriyathi‐Seferi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.13+JOS.15.14+JOS.15.15+JOS.15.16+JOS.15.17+JOS.15.18+JOS.15.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 15:13–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UKalebi wathi: Lowo ohlasela iKiriyathi‐Seferi, alithumbe, ngizamendisela indodakazi yami uAkisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UOthiniyeli indodana kaKenaza umnawakhe kaKalebi walithumba; uKalebi wasemendisela uAkisa indodakazi yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAkisa ekufikeni kwakhe kuye, umkakhe wamncenga ukuba amcelele insimu kuyise; uAkisa wasesehla kubabhemi wakhe, uKalebi wathi kuye: Ukhala ngani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi kuye: Akungiphe isipho, lokhu ungibeke elizweni elomileyo laseNegebi; ngiphe imithombo yamanzi. UKalebi wasemnika imithombo engaphezulu lengaphansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzalo yomKeni, uyisezala kaMose, yasuka labakoJuda emzini waMalala, baya enkangala yakoJuda eningizimu kweAradi; bahlala phakathi kwamaAmaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJuda wahamba loSimeyoni umfowabo, banqoba amaKanani ayehlala eZefathi, iZefathi balichitha nya. Ngakho umuzi lowo wasuthiwa yiHorma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJuda kalithumbanga iGaza lelizwe lakhona, leAshikeloni lelizwe lakhona, leEkroni lelizwe lakhona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yayilaye uJuda, wathumba ilizwe lasezintabeni, kodwa wehluleka ukubaxotsha abakhileyo esigodini, ngoba babelezinqola zokulwa zensimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IHebroni lanikwa uKalebi njengokutsho kukaMose; waxotsha kilo amadodana amathathu kaAnaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.13+JOS.15.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 15:13–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abakoBenjamini kabawaxotshanga amaJebusi ayehlala eJerusalema; ngakho amaJebusi ahlala labakoBenjamini eJerusalema kuze kube lamhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 15:63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 11:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoJosefa bahlasela iBetheli, iNkosi yayilabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathuma inhloli ukuhlola iBetheli; ibizo lalowomuzi kuqala lalithiwa yiLuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezinhloli zabona umuntu ephuma emzini, zathi kuye: Akusitshengise ukuba singangena njani emzini, sizakukuphatha ngomusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebatshengisa; bawuchitha umuzi ngomkhonto, kodwa bamyekela lowomuntu ukuba ahambe layo yonke indlu yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowomuntu waya elizweni lamaHethi, wakha khona umuzi, wawubiza ngokuthi yiLuzi; kuselibizo lawo kuze kube lamhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
